          "short": "Parallel.",
          "worked": "$$6\\underset{\\sim}{a}+10\\underset{\\sim}{b}=2(3\\underset{\\sim}{a}+5\\underset{\\sim}{b})$$\nThe vectors are scalar multiples, so they are parallel.",
