        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Not parallel.",
          "worked": "$$\\frac84=2,\\qquad \\frac{-15}{-7}=\\frac{15}{7}\\ne2$$\nThe coefficients have different scale factors, so the vectors are not parallel.",
