          "short": "Parallel.",
          "worked": "$$-8\\underset{\\sim}{a}-36\\underset{\\sim}{b}=-4(2\\underset{\\sim}{a}+9\\underset{\\sim}{b})$$\nThe vectors are scalar multiples, so they are parallel.",
