          "short": "Parallel.",
          "worked": "$$3\\underset{\\sim}{c}-18\\underset{\\sim}{d}=-3(-\\underset{\\sim}{c}+6\\underset{\\sim}{d})$$\nThe vectors are scalar multiples, so they are parallel.",
